    "description": "# DL-2: Commercial Terms\n\n_Capture the commercial deal terms that drive payout calculations and reporting targets._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Payout Model (picklist)\n\n* Currency (picklist)\n* CPA Amount\n* Deal Pitch Link (file link)\n* Deposit Range\n* Avg Deposit Target\n* Monthly Cap\n* Qualifying Action\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Deal Pitch Link is a single link per deal, not multiple.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: DL-2 (Deal Record User Stories doc).\n* Correction to source doc: the doc attributes the confirmation quote to \"Kobi Kunasekaran & Joyce Kiddell\" — the transcript shows it as a single Kobi Kunasekaran turn (he asks and answers his own question, same pattern seen elsewhere in this meeting). See comment for the corrected quote.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Deal Record User Stories — Google Doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IIfaPIol2HmX8v09gw0SKQyCuoHTiwrJxdDNc7qtvB8/edit)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 40:20 (confirms one pitch link per deal)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=2420)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-212 — Deal: Object + Core Details](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693597664441/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Deal record documentation review.\n\n",
