          "id": "10456",
          "body": "Restructured IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS to the absolute-spec standard — removed the embedded quote. For context (attribution corrected — this is a single Kobi Kunasekaran turn, not Kobi & Joyce as the source doc has it):\n\nKobi Kunasekaran, Aug 18 Weekly Sync (40:20): \"With that pitch link, did we decide it's going to be one link for the deal, or would you have multiple links? It would just be one. Just one? Okay. Yep, yep, yep.\"",
